# o_\ is monadic: a name has one arity (B9), so permuting the axes is
# t_ranspose, and a left argument to o_\ is a type error (B17).
== SOURCE
1 2 o_\ 2 2 r_eshape r_ange 4
== ERROR
error[type-mismatch]: expected a number, found Int -> a
 --> -e:1:1
  |
1 | 1 2 o_\ 2 2 r_eshape r_ange 4
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  |         --------------------- this is an Int
  = note: `o_\` has type a -> a
